/**
 *
 * @defgroup geant4 geant4
 *   The code for the Geant4 toolkit.
 *
 *   Geant4's code is organised into a series of _categories_ that contain the
 *   code for specific capabilities.
 *
 *   @defgroup event event
 *     @ingroup geant4
 *     This is the event category.
 * 
 *   @defgroup global global
 *     @ingroup geant4
 *     This is the global category
 *   @defgroup global_management management
 *     @ingroup global
 *     This is the management subcategory of the global category
 *
 *     @todo How to name nested groups (arguments to defgroup)?
 *
 *
 *   @defgroup geometry geometry
 *     @ingroup geant4
 *     Top level category for Geant4's geometry modeling and navigation code.
 *     
 *     More detailed documentation can go here.
 *
 *     @sa global_management
 *
 *     @defgroup geometry_management management
 *       @ingroup geometry
 *       This is the management subcategory of the geometry category
 **/
